family: ExtOp
name: ExtRippleBottom
value: next
status: active
doc: ExtRippleBottom: the tail of a granted ripple's trigger body (gorge effRippleBottom): every card of the resolution's remembered set still in its owner's library goes to the bottom of that library, in remembered order. Two or more pose the owner the CR 401.4 arrangement ask (ChArrange, gorge libraryPlacementOrder over the cards still at the top — the ask precedes the move), and the answer's order is the bottom order (libraryOrderPlacement bottom=true); one or none bottoms unasked. A cast card is on the stack and skipped; a card a response moved is skipped by the same zone recheck (gorge's placed). The kernel-native ripple body arms it (kw_ripple.go rippleProg); no ExtLibPlace bracket, the op asks itself. dirac/kw_ripple.go rippleBottomExt.
